      value: Mani (Fisher)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1079155329661015661, guid: 05eb25ed3c32be24ba4d5f6be2df36ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: displayNameTa
      value: "\u0BAE\u0BA3\u0BBF (\u0BAE\u0BC0\u0BA9\u0BB5\u0BB0\u0BCD)"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1079155329661015661, guid: 05eb25ed3c32be24ba4d5f6be2df36ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: profileDescription
      value: "\u0BAA\u0BBE\u0BB0\u0BAE\u0BCD\u0BAA\u0BB0\u0BBF\u0BAF \u0BB5\u0BB2\u0BC8 \u0BB5\u0BC0\u0B9A\u0BBF \u0BAE\u0BC0\u0BA9\u0BCD\u0BAA\u0BBF\u0B9F\u0BBF\u0B95\u0BCD\u0B95\u0BC1\u0BAE\u0BCD \u0BAA\u0B9F\u0B95\u0BCB\u0B9F\u0BCD\u0B9F\u0BBF \u0BAE\u0BA3\u0BBF."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1079155329661015661, guid: 05eb25ed3c32be24ba4d5f6be2df36ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueNodes.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1079155329661015661, guid: 05eb25ed3c32be24ba4d5f6be2df36ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueNodes.Array.data[0].speakerTextEn
      value: The mangrove water is getting saltier every year. You should see Pichavaram before it's gone.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1079155329661015661, guid: 05eb25ed3c32be24ba4d5f6be2df36ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueNodes.Array.data[0].speakerTextTa
      value: "\u0BAE\u0BA3\u0BCD\u0B9F\u0BB2 \u0BA8\u0BC0\u0BB0\u0BCD \u0B92\u0BB5\u0BCD\u0BB5\u0BCA\u0BB0\u0BC1 \u0BB5\u0BB0\u0BC1\u0B9A\u0BAE\u0BC1\u0BAE\u0BCD \u0B89\u0BAA\u0BCD\u0BAA\u0BBE\u0B9F\u0B95\u0BBF\u0BB1\u0BA4\u0BC1. \u0BAA\u0BBF\u0B9A\u0BCD\u0B9A\u0BBE\u0BB5\u0BB0\u0BAE\u0BCD \u0B9A\u0BC7\u0BB0\u0BB1\u0BA4\u0BB1\u0BCD\u0B95\u0BC1 \u0BAE\u0BC1\u0BA9\u0BCD\u0BA9\u0BBE\u0B9F\u0BBF \u0BAA\u0BBE\u0BB0\u0BC1\u0B99\u0BCD\u0B95."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1079155329661015661, guid: 05eb25ed3c32be24ba4d5f6be2df36ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueNodes.Array.data[0].choices.Array.size
